note EventMath v1.8 — The Complex Axis
note Math was always in here. Now we name it.
note
note  merge       = +      take away    = -
note  overlap     = ×      break into   = ÷
note  rewind of   = √      zoom in      = ^  (exponent)
note  zoom out    = log    zoom meta    = meta-governance
note
note  past = -1   present = 0   future = 1
note
note  negative dimension = opposite polarity torus (clockwise, nucleus inverted)
note  bound = creates the complex axis: i, -i, R, -R, C

