note ── Bind them: creates the full complex axis ──
note  bridge     = i     (the imaginary unit)
note  anti-bridge = -i   (equal and opposite)
note  meta       = R     (the real number line)
note  anti-meta  = -R    (negative real line)
note  grand      = C     (the complex plane)

bound negative thirteen and positive thirteen into dimensional axis

show dimensional axis

